    },
    {
      "id": "protocol-steps",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "1. All ranks compute local cuts\n2. Each rank writes cuts to local Write Buffer (64 MB)\n3. Non-leader ranks call MPI_Win_fence (wait)\n4. Leader (Rank 0) gathers cuts via MPI_Allgatherv\n5. Leader commits new cuts to Shared Window\n6. MPI_Win_fence releases — all ranks see updates\n7. All ranks resume with updated FCF",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 106,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0.8,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 500740003,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },


