    {
      "id": "legend-summary-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 876,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Total: 22.5 GB per node (93% memory efficient)\nShared: 21 GB NUMA-interleaved cut storage (120 stages, 8 chunks)\nLocal: 8 x 192 MB = 1.5 GB (write buffers + solver workspaces)\nComm: Leader-only inter-node Allgatherv + MPI_Win_fence sync\nScaling: 7.5x memory reduction vs. fully replicated (168 GB -> 22.5 GB)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 76,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
